    "content_text": "Welcome to my 2nd channel! Be sure to subscribe cause I will be posting on here more often!\n\n2nd Channel: https://www.youtube.com/@TamersDandys...\nMain channel: https://www.youtube.com/@Tamers12345MLP\n\n\nLast week while trying to premiere a new Dandy's World episode on my main channel, Tamers12345MLP, I got a strike which prevented me from posting anything for 7 days. So to make sure that doesn't happen again and to play it safe this week, I decided I'll be premiering Dandys World Halloween Special on this 2nd channel instead!\n\nI also decided I'm going to be using this channel a whole lot more too to post a lot more stupid shit where I don't have to worry about being copyright striked. Things like playing games, reacting to stuff, commentary videos, and pretty much anything that isn't just 20-40 minute animations. So if you haven't subscribed already be sure to do that!",
